    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσφρ-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make to smell,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλήχωνι αὑτὸν ἀποσφραίνει</span> he
