			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.6.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥρμοσεν ἀποσφρανθέν</span>”
				<i>when smelt at,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.54
				</span></i>
			.</div>
